  "result": "Done! Added `addLine()` and `removeLine()` to src/invoices.js:\n\n**addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })** \u2014 Adds or updates a line:\n- If SKU doesn't exist: appends a new line with product data from the catalogue\n- If SKU exists: increases that line's qty\n- Validates qty (positive integer) and SKU like `createInvoice()`\n- Returns `fail('NOT_DRAFT')` if invoice status isn't 'draft'\n\n**removeLine(invoice, sku)** \u2014 Removes a line by SKU:\n- Returns `fail('NOT_DRAFT')` if status isn't 'draft'\n- Returns `fail('LINE_NOT_FOUND')` if SKU not on invoice\n- Returns `fail('NO_LINES')` if it would remove the last line\n\nAdded two error codes:\n- `NOT_DRAFT`: for non-draft invoices\n- `LINE_NOT_FOUND`: when removing a non-existent SKU\n\n15 new tests cover all cases: adding/increasing lines, preserving data, status checks, validation, immutability. All 52 tests pass.",
